    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A door opens.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me. My wife and I—",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "INNKEEPER 1",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No room.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "DOOR SHUTS.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph stares at the closed door.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary waits behind him.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph turns and summons confidence.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There’s another place.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "All right.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "They move.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "SECOND DOOR",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "KNOCK. KNOCK.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A tired Innkeeper opens. Behind them, people are already packed into every usable space.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please. We’ve traveled from Nazareth.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "INNKEEPER 2",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry. We’re full.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Even a corner?",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The Innkeeper looks toward Mary and genuinely wishes the answer were different.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "INNKEEPER 2",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I already have families sleeping on the floor.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "INNKEEPER 2",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t have anywhere else.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph takes that in.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The door closes.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’ll find somewhere.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary studies him. She hears the strain under the certainty.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Joseph.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’re fine.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I didn’t ask.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "They move.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "THE “NO ROOM” RHYTHM",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "UNDERSCORE BEGINS",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The knocking becomes part of the score.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "KNOCK.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VOICE",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "No room.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "KNOCK-KNOCK.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VOICE",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Full.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "KNOCK.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please—",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "SHUT.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VOICE",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Sorry.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph moves faster.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "KNOCK-KNOCK-KNOCK.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My wife is—",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VOICE",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Nothing!",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "SHUT.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The rhythm builds: KNOCK. NO ROOM. KNOCK. FULL. KNOCK-KNOCK. SORRY.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Bethlehem moves around them: travelers, children, bundles, animals, families, people searching for their own names and their own places.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "No one is cruel by design. Everyone is already carrying something.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph’s explanations get shorter.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "KNOCK.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "VOICE",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "I’m sorry.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "SHUT.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Everyone seems to have somewhere to go.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "No one has a place for them.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Then Mary stops.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "MUSIC CUTS.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "LABOR BECOMES REAL",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary steadies herself. Her breathing changes.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph turns instantly.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mary?",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary raises one hand: wait.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph waits.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "She breathes through it.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "It passes.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Was that—",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is it time?",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph stares at her.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe?",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Joseph...",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We need somewhere.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The objective changes.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph is no longer searching for a proper room. Only somewhere safe.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stay here.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mary—",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not standing alone in the middle of Bethlehem.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph catches himself.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "All right.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He offers his hand.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Together.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary takes it.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "THE FINAL DOOR",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph reaches another door.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "KNOCK! KNOCK! KNOCK!",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The door opens.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "INNKEEPER ELI",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Yes?",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "That is all he has for a moment.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My wife is having a child.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Eli looks toward Mary.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We don’t need a room.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "A corner. A floor. Anything.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Just somewhere safe.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Eli is genuinely pained.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "INNKEEPER ELI",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "I have people everywhere.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He looks back inside.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "INNKEEPER ELI",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "I don’t even have floor left.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph’s hope empties.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "INNKEEPER ELI",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "I’m sorry.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The door closes.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "SILENCE.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "No music. No crowd rhythm.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph looks around Bethlehem.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "For the first time, there is no next door in his mind.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "JOSEPH’S BREAKING POINT",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "For what?",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He gestures helplessly at everything.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I should’ve found somewhere. I should’ve planned better. I should have—",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Joseph.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I should’ve—",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stop.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He stops.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary moves toward him as much as she comfortably can.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stay with me.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mary, you need somewhere safe.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And I can’t—",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I didn’t ask you to fix Bethlehem.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "That lands.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I didn’t ask you to make a room appear.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph looks at her, emptied of answers.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then what am I supposed to do?",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stay.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "SILENCE.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know what to do.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary looks directly at him.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Neither do I.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But we’re here.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Give the moment room.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "ANNA MAKES ROOM",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wait.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph turns.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna, Eli’s wife, has stepped out from the household. She has heard enough.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We don’t have a room.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph’s face falls again.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But there’s a place behind the house.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "A place?",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna hesitates, almost embarrassed to offer it.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Where we keep the animals.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph looks at her.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The animals.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s covered. There’s straw.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not much, but it’s dry.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph looks toward Mary. This is not what he wanted for her.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Another contraction begins.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph moves toward Mary, but waits for her cue.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary breathes through it.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Then looks at Anna.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’ll take it.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mary—",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary looks at him.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s a place.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph understands the lesson before she has to repeat it.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "All right.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna nods.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Come with me.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "THE SHELTER",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The animal shelter is revealed.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Do not make it beautiful yet.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "It is rough, dim, straw-covered, practical and imperfect.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A feeding trough sits nearby. Animal sounds may be heard, but avoid comic animal business.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It isn’t much.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s enough.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna hears the gratitude in that.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph looks at the space.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "This time his builder instinct is useful.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "May I move this?",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Anything you need.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph clears straw, checks the ground, shifts a crate, tests what is stable.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He is not trying to transform the shelter into the house he imagined.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He is making this place safer for Mary.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mary. This side is better.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He notices the feeding trough and marks where it can remain, clear of Mary's resting place.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Stops.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He looks at it.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He checks the space around it. The careful cleaning and lining will follow while Anna helps Mary.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He finds the clean cloth among their belongings and keeps it ready.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna returns with water and a clean cloth.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Here.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna looks toward Mary.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ve helped with births before.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary’s relief is immediate.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You have?",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Beat.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNA",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You won’t be alone.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary looks at her.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thank you, Anna.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna begins preparing.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "No grand speech. She simply helps.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "THE WORLD BECOMES QUIET",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Bethlehem’s noise begins to disappear.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The knocking rhythm is gone.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Crowd movement thins.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The LED simplifies rather than becomes more spectacular.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Lighting narrows.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The production begins removing things.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary settles briefly at the shelter edge, with room for Joseph to kneel beside her.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna prepares the private same-side route and stays close.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph kneels beside Mary.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Joseph.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He takes her hand.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m here.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "SILENCE.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "That is enough. After their shared moment, Mary accepts Anna's support. Anna helps Mary exit through the agreed masked same-side opening into the private change bay. Joseph remains in the shelter.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "“SILENT NIGHT” — INSTRUMENTAL / MANGER PREPARATION",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "SC11-A — INSTRUMENTAL COVER: as Mary and Anna exit, begin a sparse instrumental “Silent Night,” with no vocals. Joseph turns to the manger, cleans it carefully, and arranges the clean lining. His work is tender and purposeful; he occasionally looks toward Mary's exit. Keep the manger stationary and the approved return lane clear.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The birth is implied offstage; no literal childbirth is shown.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "At the private same-side bay, a dedicated dresser assists Mary in removing W01, adjusting the approved birth look and journey layers, and checking mic-pack/cable placement. Anna accompanies Mary in character; she is not the sole dresser or privacy operator. Return W01 to its labeled covered bag. Rehearse the actual change and route.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Keep a quiet shelter image on LED 11B. Focus stage light on Joseph, leaving the masked change and return route concealed from front and side seats.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The instrumental has a repeatable middle and can hold as needed. Joseph remains available within the shelter; his preparation shows care, not an attempt to control the birth.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "Time passes through the instrumental, Joseph's purposeful preparation, and restrained changes in light. The arrangement and measured change time remain to be confirmed; do not use a fixed countdown.",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Do not make the star the event yet. If visible, it should emerge with extraordinary restraint.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "SC11-B — CONCEALED RETURN: after Wardrobe confirms costume readiness and Sound confirms mic readiness, Stage Management cues Mary and Anna's unseen return. Use the agreed low-light masked route; Mary settles into her approved seated position, without the prosthetic. Do not reveal her walking in.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna retrieves the one swaddled performance doll from the clean same-side preset and places it securely in Mary's arms after Mary is seated. Anna clears the central image and reports the seated-position / secure-doll ready check to Stage Management.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Only after Wardrobe, Sound, and the backstage lead confirm readiness does Stage Management call SC11-C: fade the instrumental to silence, then cue the baby cry and the small warm family reveal. Keep the LED subdued; no full-stage blackout or screen flash.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The baby cry reveals Mary already seated with the child. It must not trigger her walk or return. Joseph turns toward the sound; Anna remains close enough to support the scene, outside the family image.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "A BABY CRIES.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "SILENCE.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Everything stops.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Do not immediately sing.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Do not immediately move.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Do not immediately brighten the LED.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Give the audience several seconds of silence to hear the child and discover Mary already seated. Keep all vocals out until the family reveal and the Mary-to-Joseph handoff have been allowed to land.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A small warm stage light reveals Mary and the child with the cry, then gently includes Joseph",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "MARY.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "THE CHILD.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "JOSEPH.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna remains slightly outside the central image.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph sees the baby.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "He cannot speak.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary looks at Joseph.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Then at the child.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "After everything, they are here.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "THE CHILD INTO JOSEPH’S ARMS",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Protect silence before this action.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph remains close but does not assume.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary looks at him.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Joseph.",
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "She invites him closer.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph comes.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary places the child into his arms.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph receives him carefully.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Do not rush to dialogue.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The man who once said, “The child... it’s not mine,” now holds the child without needing to explain himself.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Mary watches him.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Joseph looks at the baby.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "This physical action completes the emotional thought. Scene 12 can give it words.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "“SILENT NIGHT” TRANSITION",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "SC11-D — VOCAL “SILENT NIGHT”: only after the cry, family reveal, held silence and the written Mary-to-Joseph handoff does the first voice enter. This continues the melody heard instrumentally during the change; it is one planned musical sequence with a silent birth-reveal break.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "One soft voice begins “Silent Night.” It should emerge from the world rather than feel like a presented solo.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Anna may begin, or the first voice may come from offstage while Anna simply watches.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A second voice may join, then perhaps two or three more Bethlehem voices.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Do not build to full-company volume here.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The manger remains the emotional center.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The shelter itself has not transformed. What happened there has transformed its meaning.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "As the musical transition continues, a separate pool of night slowly appears elsewhere: open field, darkness, the suggestion of shepherds.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Keep the manger visible simultaneously.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "No blackout.",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "transition",
      "text": "END SCENE 11 / CONTINUE INTO SCENE 12",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_5"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "NOTES",
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "Scene 11 should feel like the pressure cooker immediately before the birth. The source is very specific that Bethlehem is not a collection of villains; the tragedy is that there is need everywhere and no one seems to have room for one more need. The scene should therefore escalate through repetition, urgency, physical exhaustion, and finally silence rather than through shouting.",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "“Silent Night” now begins instrumentally while Mary exits with Anna and Joseph prepares the manger. The instrumental fades to silence before the baby cry and family reveal. Vocals begin only after the held silence and Mary-to-Joseph handoff, continuing into Scene 12.",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "The emotional center of this scene is the sequence",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "JOSEPH: “I don't know what to do.”",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "MARY: “Neither do I. But we're here.”",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "followed later by",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "MARY: “Joseph.”",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "JOSEPH: “I'm here.”",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "That completes a major part of Joseph's builder arc. The source specifically frames this as the moment when his gifts become useful after he stops trying to control the entire story. He cannot create a room, shorten the road, control Caesar, or prevent labor. But when an imperfect shelter is offered, he knows how to clear it, prepare it and make it safer for Mary.",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "production-note",
      "text": "Preserve this cue order: Mary's “Joseph” / Joseph's “I'm here” → Mary and Anna exit → instrumental “Silent Night” while Joseph prepares the manger and Wardrobe removes the prosthetic → concealed seated return and secure doll → instrumental fade → baby cry and small warm family reveal → held silence → Mary-to-Joseph handoff → vocal “Silent Night.” No full-stage blackout, literal birth image, or fixed change countdown.",
      "namedStyleType": "SUBTITLE"
    }
  ]
}
